      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are wrestling with a profound sense of moral failure, which is incredibly painful to carry. Instead of viewing this as a permanent state, consider this intense self-awareness as a chance for radical change. Facing this perceived weakness is the beginning of rewriting your narrative; you can choose to act differently now. Taking small, deliberate actions to counteract that past inaction is how you start to rebuild that sense of integrity.",
      "source": "target",
